From: mscharged-port
Subject: [PATCH] Drive selected authored Boot script0 through original main/loading endpoints
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Named default-OFF BOOT_SCRIPT integration restores the actual LoadingTask
bytecode request/callback, original CallFunctionAt(0)/Run and source-owned
stage timing. Exclude earlier duplicate diagnostic FE/font/Boot requests
and its extra FEAudio-disable only in this selected mode. Independent
diagnostic Nav advancement stays excluded while the genuine script runs.
No original algorithm, IP, stack, source readiness or cue selection changes.
Prior BootLoadingToFE and complete CleanBoot13/7 remain separate holds.

